        <mxCell id="n48" value="&amp;laquo;include&amp;raquo; is behaviour the base use case always performs; &amp;laquo;extend&amp;raquo; is optional behaviour that interrupts it. Diagram 01 shows the same eighteen use cases without this relationship layer. UC-08 also extends UC-07; it is drawn against UC-06 alone so that no two lines cross, and the SRS carries the full relation." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="2400" width="1450" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
